[00:18.19]Precious to God, we are daughters and sons,
[00:24.08]Giving our strength as his faithful young ones.
[00:33.70]Loving attention to us he will give,
[00:40.93]Blessing our days for as long as we live.
[01:20.96]Honoring parents who care for our lives
[01:28.47]Helps us express what we’re feeling inside.
[01:35.06]Then we find favor with God and with men,
[01:42.43]Drawing us close to Jehovah, our Friend.
[02:15.13]May we remember our God in our youth,
[02:20.87]Growing each day in our love of the truth.
[02:26.66]Giving our best to our God, we will bring
[02:33.76]Joy to the heart of Jehovah, our King.
